and naive implementation:


    public static  List removeMany(List items) {
    int i = 0;
    Iterator iter = items.iterator();
    while (iter.hasNext()) {
    T item = iter.next();
    //  goes here
    if (/*: */i % 2 == 0) {
    iter.remove();
    }
