How to copy a java.util.List into another java.util.List 

I have a `List` that is populated from a Web Service. I want to copy/clone the contents of that list into an empty list of the same type. A Google search for copying a list suggested me to use `Collections.copy()` method. In all the examples I saw, the destination list was supposed to contain the exact number of items for the copying to take place. 

