Creating a list of Exceptions in java 

I want to create a list of Exceptions in java. Something like - 


    List ex = new ArrayList();
    ex.add(NotFoundException.class);


but on doing so I am getting en error - 


    The method add(Exception) in the type List is not applicable for the arguments (Class)


Eclipse IDE suggest to change to `addAll()` but that didn't solve the issue either.

Can someone please let me know how can we build a `List` or `Collection` of `Exception`s?

You're adding classes, not exceptions.


    List> ex = new ArrayList<>();
    ex.add(Exception.class);

