You misinterpreted what `Collections.reverse` does. This method reverses the list that you gave, not its content. Since you called this method with a list having a single element, the result will be the same list. If you want to reverse a String, please refer to this question. As a side-note: do not use raw types like `ArrayList`, this will get into trouble. Prefer the type-safe way `ArrayList`.

